                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d3c428d-e826-40df-aecd-93d2892603cd",
                                                "sense_id": "c38a8a57-6649-3e2f-83ae-9320c9a571e2",
                                                "text": "Int.[:] What types of things have you learnt about at AIME, like about yourselves or about others?\nDeon[:] To be confident.\nGreg[:] Yeah be confident. And not be shame…"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e44bad0-60ce-4f4a-b240-9f50ed63dcb5",
                                                "sense_id": "c38a8a57-6649-3e2f-83ae-9320c9a571e2",
                                                "text": "Aunty Gracelyn is most famous for her role in developing 'Condoman', the Indigenous superhero whose catchcry and public health message 'don’t be shame be game, use condoms!' became a defining figure of Australia's HIV and AIDS crisis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
